<title>MALAYSIA: Wing Tiek requests stock suspension.</title>
<headline>Wing Tiek requests stock suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian industrial group Wing Tiek Holdings Bhd requested the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange to immediately suspend its shares from being traded, in a statement issued on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said the suspension was being requested &quot;pending an announcement to be made later&quot;.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
